            <ArticleTitle>Cardiac function recovery following LVAD implantation and bariatric surgery in a morbidly obese patient.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>740-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1111/jocs.12404</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We present a morbidly obese 44-year-old female who underwent Thoratec HeartMate II left ventricular assist device implantation. The patient subsequently underwent laparoscopic sleeve gastrectomy and removal of the LVAD following improvement in her cardiac function.</AbstractText>
